# bundle_name|gradle_project|loom_refmap
# CLIENT-environment mods. These ship in the modpack's overrides/mods/ and must
# never reach a server's data/mods/ — deploy.sh and dev-up.sh read local-mods
# only. The class-count floor is 1 here, not 10: a client mod can legitimately
# be a handful of classes, and the refmap is the gate that actually catches an
# unremapped jar.
customdimensionsclient.jar|custom-dimensions-client|customdimensionsclient-refmap.json
